OL,3,AKing's role is not policy making, says
OL,4,APalace in slavery apology row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King's role as head of the
OL,7,FCommonwealth is about "inspiring and
OL,8,Fconvening, rather than policy making",
OL,9,Fsays Buckingham Palace - distancing him
OL,10,Ffrom rows over whether the UK should
OL,11,Fapologise and make reparations for its
OL,12,Fpart in the Atlantic slave trade.
OL,14,FThe Palace statement clarifying the
OL,15,FKing's non-political role in the
OL,16,FCommonwealth comes as the
OL,17,Forganisation's leaders gather for a
OL,18,Fsummit in Antigua and Barbuda.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
