OL,3,ATwo boys arrested after Halloween party
OL,4,Astabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after
OL,8,Ffive teenagers were stabbed at a
OL,9,FHalloween party.
OL,11,FOfficers said they were called shortly
OL,12,Fafter 22:30 GMT on Saturday to Park
OL,13,FRoad in Chandler's Ford, Hampshire,
OL,14,Fwhere an "unknown group" had gained
OL,15,Fentry to the event.
OL,17,FPolice said two boys remain in hospital
OL,18,Fhaving suffered serious injuries, with
OL,19,Fone 17-year-old victim in a
OL,20,Flife-threatening condition. The others
OL,21,Fhave been discharged from hospital.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
