OL,3,AFighting returns to Kherson region
OL,4,Aafter longest Ukraine war ceasefire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday morning, local authorities
OL,7,Fconfirmed that strikes had resumed,
OL,8,Fsaying Moscow had hit a medical
OL,9,Ffacility in Kherson city centre. They
OL,10,Falso said a 62-year-old woman and a
OL,11,F73-year-old man were injured when a
OL,12,FRussian drone attacked the car they
OL,13,Fwere travelling in.
OL,15,FUkraine also accused Russian forces of
OL,16,Fusing the humanitarian ceasefire to
OL,17,Fstrengthen their military positions,
OL,18,Frotate units and deliver ammunition.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
